			<h2 id="disputes">21. If something goes wrong between us</h2>
			<p>
				<strong>In short:</strong> talk to us first. These terms are governed by New Zealand law, and
				New Zealand courts decide disputes.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					If you have a problem, email us first. We will try in good faith to sort it out with you
